> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">29</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:700px;"><img src="http://fondationscp.wikidot.com/local--files/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph/2ctober29" style="width:700px;" alt="2ctober29" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:700px;"> <p>Memorandum dated 6 November 1944</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">30</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:700px;"><img src="http://fondationscp.wikidot.com/local--files/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph/2ctober30" style="width:700px;" alt="2ctober30" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:700px;"> <p>SCP-400-FR</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">31</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:700px;"><img src="http://fondationscp.wikidot.com/local--files/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph/2ctober31" style="width:700px;" alt="2ctober31" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:70