					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5334</guid>
				<title>SCP-5334</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5334</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5334&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5334 must be contained in a locked container at all times at Site-64. A transparent window must be in place within the container. Two guards must remain at the entrance to SCP-5334. When entering SCP-5334, two guards must be with personnel at all times. Guards must also be armed with flame throwers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5334 is a 8 feet long, 1 foot wide, and 2 feet, 6 inches tall Chilopoda. SCP-5334&#039;s body segments are covered in a thick shell, with dark brown stripes covering the black shell. Protruding from the shells are 2 feet tall horns, which are used as a defense mechanism. A pair of legs appear on every body segment. SCP-5334 has around 173 body segments. SCP-5334&#039;s head is an inch longer than its body segments, and contains a horn at the tip oh it&#039;s head. The horn is a inch larger than the previous horns. Two 1 foot antennae protrude from the face of SCP-5334 as well in back end. Two pincers, 1 foot and 8 inches each, are attached to SCP-5334&#039;s head, which are used to grab and crush prey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5334 has been seen to crawl on walls and on the ceiling, but hardly ever does so. SCP-5334 has shown intelligence of a 12 year old human, such as recognizing faces, and threat. When approaching SCP-5334, SCP-5334 would try to crush its target with its large pincers. After the target is killed, SCP-5334 would tear away its skin and suck its blood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;[SCP-5334a]&lt;/strong&gt; If a human or an animal has been brushed by the antennae of SCP-5334, the human or animal should be terminated immediately. Corpses, of any species, should be burned immediately. If a target has been brushed by the antennae of SCP-5334, the target would die in 3 to 5 minutes. Their corpse would split open at the chest area, revealing four thin legs, reminiscent of SCP-5334. The legs would lift up the corpse. The face splits open and two large horns protrude from its face. The entity is known as SCP-5334-1. SCP-5334-1 is hostile against all life, and will attack anything it sees, except SCP-5334. SCP-5334-1 can&#039;t be destroyed by gunfire, even if multiple organs have been obliterated. SCP-5334-1 can only be destroyed by fire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;[SCP-5334b]&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5334 was found in a old home in Kokomo, Indiana, two months after a meteorite had struck a 16 meters away. SCP-5334 attacked the couple living at the home, and turned her into SCP-5334-1. The husband managed to burn SCP-5334-1 with fire, but the same didn&#039;t work with SCP-5334. An SCP team, who were about to take the meteorite to the facility, was alerted by the noise and went to investigate it. SCP-5334 was successfully secured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;[SCP-5334c]&lt;/strong&gt; Whenever Jupiter appears in the night sky, SCP-5334 will stop everything it&#039;s doing, and look up at Jupiter. SCP-5334 would not react to any external stimuli. SCP-5334 would start moving again once Jupiter has passed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5333&quot;&gt;SCP-5333&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5334 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5335&quot;&gt;SCP-5335&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pickled29&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7116403&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1610052004&quot; alt=&quot;Pickled29&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7116403)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pickled29&quot;  &gt;Pickled29&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 07 Jan 2021 15:37:13 +0000</pubDate>
