&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-94182-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. With the exception of sequences of each note appearing in tandem uniformly.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-94182-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Some versions of a Spanish Eight Tone Scale can be adapted to contain the notes of &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;███&lt;/span&gt;-3955.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-94182-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Methodical Colloquialism Division&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
