&lt;td&gt;Necropsar&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Item currently has no reliable evidence supporting its existence in the standard Human History Process (H-001), but can be confirmed to potentially exist through observations made by the Department of Historical Observation and Planning regarding other Human History Processes and hidden signs currently in H-001.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1050&quot;&gt;SCP-CN-1050&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Pantokratōr&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Item is too large for containment to be realistic.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ja.scp-wiki.net/indonootoko-s-proposal&quot;&gt;Indonootoko&#039;s Proposal (JP)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/indonootoko-s-proposal-iii&quot;&gt;Indonootoko&#039;s Proposal III (JP)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Tenebrarius&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The Foundation does not and cannot possess information about the item.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.net.pl/scp-pl-290&quot;&gt;SCP-PL-290&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4665703&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1610052009&quot; alt=&quot;Nagiros&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4665703)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros&quot;  &gt;Nagiros&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-572128-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Translated as &amp;quot;Abnormal&amp;quot; in some foreign branches.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-572128-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. A re-engineered designation of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/object-classes#toc9&quot;&gt;the defunct object class&lt;/a&gt; of the same name.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-572128-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Original text: Ты - аномалия, опухоль миров&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-572128-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Some translation errors may persist; informed readers are welcome to update a foreign class&#039; definition if they have the consent of the author or are otherwise certain of a better definition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-572128-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Original text: Атлант&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
